 izer about any additional eligibility requirements.\n\nCost: No charge is 
 listed in the organizer’s announcement.\n\nThe November 2026 distributio
 n schedule lists 8–10 a.m.\; supplies may run out earlier.\n\nSource: Ca
 tholic Charities Diocese of Fresno — Merced\nhttps://ccdof.org/wp-conten
 t/uploads/2026/10/MER-Thanksgiving-Distribution-2026.pdf
